# Every /api/v1/rolls request needs an HS256 token signed with Jwt:SigningKey,
# issuer "diceroller", audience "diceroller", and a user id (Guid) as "sub".
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5102
@token = paste-a-dev-token-here

### Roll two dice → 201 + Location
# @name roll
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rolls
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get the roll just created → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rolls/{{roll.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a roll that does not exist (or belongs to someone else) → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rolls/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### History, default: newest first, page 1 of 10
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rolls
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by year
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rolls?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by year + month
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rolls?year=2026&month=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by year + month + day
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rolls?year=2026&month=10&day=8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Highest sum first (newest first among equal sums)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rolls?sortBySum=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Oldest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rolls?sortByDate=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Both sorts: sum ascending dominates, date descending breaks ties
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rolls?sortBySum=asc&sortByDate=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Page 2 of 5
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rolls?page=2&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Everything at once
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rolls?year=2026&month=10&sortBySum=desc&sortByDate=asc&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid: day without month → 400 with per-field errors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rolls?year=2026&day=8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### No token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rolls
